# Commits that changed formatting only, and would otherwise sit on top of every
# `git blame` line they touched.
#
# Enable locally with:
#
#     git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitHub's blame view reads this file automatically — no configuration needed.
#
# Add a full 40-character SHA per line, with a comment saying what it was.
# Nothing but pure reformats belongs here: a commit listed here becomes
# invisible to blame, so anything that changed behavior must never be added.

# (No reformat commit yet — the one-time `swiftformat` run lands via the
# Reformat workflow, and its SHA goes here in the same PR that drops
# `continue-on-error` from the format check in ci.yml.)
